Explain a diagnostic code and how to fix it

Prints what the code means, an example, and how to fix it.

Usage: opentide explain [code]

Arguments:
  [code]
          A diagnostic code, such as vocab_unknown. Omit it to list every code.

Options:
      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide explain vocab_unknown
  $ opentide explain

